window.products.push({"id":609049,"name":"Isaac Jacobs 4x6 White Textured Leather (Vertical & Horizontal) & Gold Metal Picture Frame, with Black Fabric Easel, Wall-Mountable, Made for Tabletop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H6Yd10RuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This Isaac Jacobs white leather and gold-edged metal picture frame has a charming allure that showcases your photographs in a stunning way. The border area is designed to resemble the appearance of fine leather. When viewed from any accent table, shelf or mantlepiece, the detailed, ridged lines of the faux leather border draw the eye toward the beauty in your photos. The thin, metal edging that surrounds both the border and the picture adds a perfect complement to the unique leather look. This frame has a classic appeal that will blend in on any desktop and can be displayed both in landscape and portrait mode. This frame has a traditional black fabric backing with a sturdy easel. Whether you fill this glass frame with photos you snapped of a sunset on the beach, or a professional shot taken at a family reunion, all photos can be displayed on your wall like works of art. If you are looking to turn a guest room into a home office, this chic frame will put a wonderful finishing touch to the décor of a room. Frame your favorite black-and-white-cityscape photo, or your most relaxing art print and transform the vibe of a room. It can be easily hung horizontally or vertically on any wall by using the built-in hooks. The frame is intended to beautifully display 4” x 6” photos. This frame comes in multiple colors and sizes. Whether you are looking for a special display frame or choosing a house-warming gift for friends or family, the frame’s simple, yet striking, quality will be appreciated by whoever sees it on display. We spend so much time flipping through images on screens all day, it feels good to see our memories and passions preserved in style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51H6Yd10RuL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Isaac Jacobs International","source_asin":"B09J9CC85H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609049","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J9CC85H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J9CC85H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
