window.products.push({"id":609094,"name":"Empire Art Direct Airplane Metal, Hand Painted Rugged Wooden Blocks Sculpture, Decor,Ready to Hang,Living Room, Bedroom ＆ Office 3D Wall Art, 60 in. x","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":201.22,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MjLKE1aoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Empire Art Direct has a long rich history of manufacturing wall art and home furnishings since 1948. Ead has a variety of wall decorative for all moments in your life.3D iron wall sculpture on slatted solid wood by Primo. Each piece involves the artist's mastery as many individual pieces of iron are cut, and welded by hand. Then they are handpainted to the artist's taste to create an exclusive work of mixed media.In visual art, mixed media is an artwork in which more than one medium or material has been employed. This piece employs Primo's master of ironwork, woodwork, and hand painting. The expressive uniqueness of Primo's wall art will enhance any environment with a one of a kind, individual work of art.Each piece is inspected and certified by the artist as an original work of art.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MjLKE1aoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Empire Art Direct","source_asin":"B07MT7JLYB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MT7JLYB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MT7JLYB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
