window.products.push({"id":609141,"name":"Epica Stainless Steel Drinking Straws, Set of 4- Free Cleaning Brush Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616jX0dPOlL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Are You Still Using Those Same Old Plastic Straws? You want to be 'Green,' but reusing plastic straws is just unsanitary, and glass straws break. Yuck! The good news is that you now have a better option. Stainless steel drinking straws are practically indestructible and can be used again and again - making them the ideal environmentally friendly choice. The Only Reusable Straws That Can Be Sanitized - Safe For Your Family Epica stainless steel drinking straws are made to be used anywhere you can use regular plastic drinking straws. But unlike plastic and glass, stainless steel straws won't break, can be completely sanitized, and are dishwasher-safe. A cleaning brush comes free with every set of straws, so you never have to worry about the strange gunk and mold that grows in regular plastic drinking straws. Perfect For Entertaining And Gift-Giving Stainless steel bent straws are incredibly sleek and modern looking. They spruce up parties and make elegant gifts for the Eco-friendly fashionista. Order Yours Today And Discover How Beautiful 'Practical' Can Be Treat your friends and family to the most uniquely practical gift of the season! The next time you are looking for a hostess or housewarming gift that is fresh, original and appropriate for Green homes, Epica stainless steel drinking straws are the perfect choice.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616jX0dPOlL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Epica","source_asin":"B00D6SRLSW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609141","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00D6SRLSW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00D6SRLSW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
