window.products.push({"id":609302,"name":"anatolian Women's Organic Cotton Body Wrap Towel - Adjustable Wrap Around After Shower Plush Terry Towels for Women to use in Gym Pool Beach Spa - Mad","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aTg5mO+sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"You will receive 1 piece of certified organic terry velour towel wrap for women with labels, tags, and instructions in a carton gift box with see thru top window. High-end genuine Made in Turkey organic luxe terry wrap also perfect for gifting.It's best to dry naturally on a clothesline. As a rule of thumb, when needed, machine wash cold in delicate cycle, tumble dry low. Like in any other cotton towel, avoid using fabric softeners or dryer sheets which coat the towel and reduce absorbency. Do not bleach.  Please make sure to keep both sides of strip closure stick together during washing process. Otherwise, terry fabric will get caught and pulled out to ruin your wrap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aTg5mO+sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Anatolian","source_asin":"B095WJCV6F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609302","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095WJCV6F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095WJCV6F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":609303,"name":"Cytheria Mini Portable Humidifier for Plants, Small Indoor 650ml Cool Mist Humidifier with 10 Filter Sticks, Night Lights, Auto-Shut off, Quiet USB At","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":18.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vjIklX9ZS._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Are you looking for Cool Mist Plant Humidifier for your small plants in the Home or officeNow, It's the ideal humidifier for you: Double Holes Heavy Mist Large and cool mist spray, Giving your plants double moisturizing. 2 Spray Modes You could adjust the mist according to the own room's humidity. Night Lights Normal light + breathing light design, creativily to meet your sleeping needs of lighting requirements. One Button Control Easy to operate both for children and the old .From now on, we will have a fresh and moist living space and improve the quality of life.Specifications: Product Name: Plant Humidifier Product Size: 5.59×3.89×3.89inches Input Voltage: 5V Product Material: ABS, PP, PVC Water Capacity: 600ml Spray Volume: 3040ml/h (Single Hole)You Will Get: Plant Humidifier ×1 Cotton Filter Sticks×10 Charging Cable×1 User Manual×1Notes For You: 1. It's recommended to add clean tap or mineral waters into humidifier. Pure or distilled water, Essential oil and perfumes are Forbidd. For it would cause water to accumulate at the mist outlet of humidifier and affect spray. 2. If you channge the cotton swab at the first time.Please take out the cotton swab from the plastic tube (not to lost that the spring inside ), soak it for 35 minutes, whole cotton swab is completely soaked and then reinstall it for using. 3. When the water level is lower than the safe water level, the humidifier will automatically stop working, which is a normal phenomenon. Just add water and restart to use. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we are willing to answer your questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vjIklX9ZS._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cytheria","source_asin":"B095RRNVKV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B095RRNVKV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B095RRNVKV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
