window.products.push({"id":609616,"name":"JOYFLY Gaming Chairs for Adults Gaming Chair Gamer Chair Ergonomic Reclining PC Chair with High Back, Headrest, and Lumbar Support(Blue)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61scwjVwIZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🕹️【PREMIUM MATERIALS】: The gaming chair for adults is made of racing-grade carbon fiber and PU leather material leather, more comfortable and durable than ordinary leather, providing you with a better touch feeling. The cushion is filled with double-layer thickened high-density memory latex, which is highly resilient and breathable. Allow you to work or play for a long time without fatigue. 🕹️【STURDY GAMER CHAIR】: One-piece all-steel frame, heavy-duty nylon base combined with thickened explosion-proof tray, tested 10,000 times to ensure excellent stability and sturdiness of the gaming chair, which can carry up to 330 lbs. Class 3 gas lift through professional certification. The gaming chair provides you with the safest and most personal protection. 🕹️【ERGONOMIC COMFORT 】: Wider and thicker backrest with latex headrest and lumbar pillow design to better fit your body curve. The back of the gaming chair for adults adopts a unique curved design, Effectively relieving pressure on the cervical spine and back to ensure your comfort. 🕹️【SUPERB FEATURES】: The backrest can be adjusted at any angle from 90° to 160°, making it as comfortable as lying in bed when you are tired. Smooth 360 ° swivel and chair Height adjustable. Rocking 15° comfortably. The linkage armrests can be adjusted with the angle of the backrest, and can effectively support the arms when lying down. The gaming chair can help you work, play, and read to find the most suitable for your body sitting position. 🕹️【EXCELLENT CUSTOMER SERVICE】: We are committed to providing you with the best quality gamer chairs, each gaming chair for adults will undergo multiple rigorous tests of high standards before packaging. We offer a 30-day unconditional refund and a 12-month limited warranty. For any questions about the gamer chair, please contact us, and we will answer you the first time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61scwjVwIZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOYFLY","source_asin":"B0BV1STHSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609616","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BV1STHSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BV1STHSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":609617,"name":"The Country House Collection Stars and Berries 24\" Curtain Tiers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Pue22EBAS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"In October 1985, Norma and Mike Delano opened The Country House in Snow Hill, Maryland. Mike was a former agricultural fertilizer salesman, and Norma was a second grade teacher. Norma quit teaching in 1972 to be a \"Mom\" to Christy and Jenny. Norma painted and sewed crafts more as the girls got older. Mike and Norma did craft shows each year. The idea of opening a store to show their handmade products as well as decorating items not available in the area came together when they opened The Country House in Snow Hill. Because of a great response at the Snow Hill store, they moved to a larger place in Salisbury, MD. After another year, they doubled that space to 5,000 sq. feet. Then after 3 years, they bought the current location, which is a 48,000 sq. foot building. It was originally built in the 1930's to be a shirt factory. It needed major repair. The family, including grandparents, plus several carpenter friends did a lot of work to prepare it to be a store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Pue22EBAS._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Country House Collection","source_asin":"B01JAGPGNA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609617","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JAGPGNA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JAGPGNA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
