window.products.push({"id":609621,"name":"LERGNA Travel Kettle Electric Small Portable,Mini Water Boiler,Portable Tea Kettle,One Cup Kettle For Hot Water/Coffee/Milk/Congee,Keep Warm,Auto Shut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Lz9ab60aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【MULTIPURPOSE KETTLE】- Portable mini kettle has 5 functions for you to preset: water boiling (100℃), coffee making/milk warming (85℃), tea/congee making (30M), auto stirring (60S) and keeping warm. Thus, your daily basic dietary needs can be met by this smart kettle. 【REAL-TIME MONITORING TEMPERATURE】- Mini electric kettle is equipped with LED temperature display which can show the temperature of the liquid in the kettle in real time. So, you can monitor the temperature in time. Besides, the 3 temperatures of keeping warm are also shown here for you to choose at will. 【KEEP WARM】- Mini electric kettle has 3 temperatures for you to choose to keep warm: 55℃(131°F), 65℃(149°F) and 85℃(185°F). Just touch the function key until four indicators light up at the same time and then go on touching to choose temperature you want the liquid to keep warm at. The kettle will boil the liquid to the holding point automatically if the temperature drops. The suggested temperature for drinking and touching the kettle is 55℃(131°F). 【DISTINCTIVE & SAFE】- Travel tea kettle is designed as a mug which is quite distinctive and fashionable. The concave stripe on the body can prevent the kettle from falling out of hands easily. 304 stainless steel, high temperature resistant PP and anti-slip silicon making up this kettle are all safe materials. 【PORTABLE & EASY USAGE】- Mini boiler is 6.9*3.5 inch with the shape of mug, quite portable for travel, business trip, office, etc. It’s also easy to use, just touch the button to adjust the functions and it will shut off automatically when the work ends (except tea making, you can stop the kettle from working at any time). Moreover, it has dry boiling-resistant protection, so please free free to use. 【Notes】- 1. The maximum capacity of the kettle is 400ML, and the capacity to the MAX water level line is 300ML. 2. TOUCH THE KETTLE 5-10MINS AFTER THE BOILING IS OVER AS THE KETTLE'S SURFACE WILL BE HOT!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Lz9ab60aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LERGNA","source_asin":"B0B62VLCLD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B62VLCLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B62VLCLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
