window.products.push({"id":609635,"name":"Küchenprofi K0966002820 Professional Stainless Steel Food Mill Silver, Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":83.13,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zvd4g+I3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EVERYDAY FUNCTIONALITY: Whether you need to make baby food, tomato sauce, or just need a potato ricer for mashed potatoes at your next family dinner, this versatile food mill will make everyday food prep a breeze. This manual food grinder and strainer is the easy practical way to improve your home kitchen experience. EASY TO USE: With its traditional design and the easy-to-turn hand crank, this food mill makes processing vegetables and fruits fast and simple. Just place the food mill on a pot or bowl, and hold the food mill by the long handle on the side. Insert one of the four discs into the food mill, fasten it, then place the crank into the middle of the disc. The crank will turn easily, and the mill will be ready for use. QUALITY MATERIALS & DESIGN: The Küchenprofi Professional Stainless Steel Food Mill is a sturdy, ergonomically designed stainless steel food mill. It is made of 18/10 stainless steel and measures 8.75 inches in diameter. It features a perforated bottom and an easy-to-turn hand crank and is dishwasher safe. INTERCHANGEABLE DISCS: A Küchenprofi classic, this food mill continues to please both home and professional chefs, turning out velvety purees, lump-free mashed potatoes, silken sauces, and more. This manual food mill comes with 4 interchangeable discs that allow you to choose between coarse, medium, fine, or extra fine. The sizes of these discs are 1.3 mm, 2.5 mm, 3 mm, and 5 mm. TRADITION OF QUALITY: Küchenprofi was founded in Germany in 1923. Designing top-tier items has distinguished this brand as one of the best in the industry. They strive to bring imagination and creativity to the home cook's kitchen and to enhance your overall cooking experience. Frieling has partnered with this brand since 2017 and proudly brings its premium quality hand tools, salt and pepper mills, and more to the US market.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zvd4g+I3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Küchenprofi","source_asin":"B0000C8T9I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609635","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000C8T9I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000C8T9I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
