window.products.push({"id":609702,"name":"urnexttour Travel Neck Pillow for Kids, Unicorn Memory Foam Pillow with Cute Sleep Mask & Earplugs, Lightweight Travelling Pillow Set for Airplane , C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w7VvfKfbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【100% Pure Memory Foam】:The Cute Unicorn U-shaped travel pillow is filled with superb quality memory foam. Our memory foam filler uses the 3-seconds return technology, makes the neck pillow can cushion your body and can effectively relieve painful pressure points for ultimate relaxation, and offers the maximum comfort on your trip. Available for adults and kids to use in travel. 【360 Degree Support】: This travel pillow is designed according to ergonomics that offers 360°support for your head and neck. The slow resilience memory foam can perfectly fit your neck, prevent your head from falling forward, help you keep your neck in its correct posture without getting a sore neck, and provide you a good sleep on a journey during the long flight, train, bus, or self-driving. 【Comfortable Fabric & Removable and Washable】: This Neck Pillow comes with a high-quality cozy cover made of spandex fabric that has a soft and smooth hand feeling and not easy to cause deformation, no pilling. The pillowcase has an invisible zipper design that can be removed for washing. So you don't need to worry about it will get dirty on the trip. 【Easy to Carry & Attach】: The product of weight is 0.66 lbs, Lightweight and Portability. With its snap button, this pillow can be attached to your carry-on luggage without taking up extra space. Its hook design can hang anywhere. Comes with a lovely Unicorn Eye mask and Christmas Tree shape earplugs to block light and sound, the pillow will help you have a more comfortable sleep. 【The Best Sleep Partner For Travel】The travel neck pillow has multi-scene applications. This pillow can provide extra support to protect the neck from pain when sitting in the seat on a plane, car, train or bus. And it is also ideal for home when you are watching TV or reading at home, and helps you fall asleep easier when you take a break after work. You can purchase for your kids, relatives, friends, colleagues, and parents. Perfect as a gift.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61w7VvfKfbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"urnexttour","source_asin":"B09DY9TKFF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609702","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DY9TKFF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DY9TKFF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
