window.products.push({"id":609711,"name":"16 Inch Stainless Steel Baking Sheet with Grid Rack and Silicone Baking Mat Set, P&P CHEF Baking Pan Tray with Cooling Rack, 3 Pcs (1 Pan + 1 Rack + 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a+3fui4VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【HEALTHY & EASY CLEANING】P&P CHEF baking sheet rack with mat are made of pure stainless steel and food-grade silicone, which can withstand high temperature up to 450-500 ℉, And will not release toxic substance to your food, Mirror finish surface can reduce the possibility of sticking, Soapy water and dishcloth can help you clean them well, Silicone mat is non-stick, Easy clean by hand and soapy sponge, Also dishwasher safe to save your time and labor 【16 INCH BAKING PAN】Baking pan with size 16 x 12 inch, Perfectly fit most regular oven, 1 Inch deep full sides help to cook more food and can contain more sauces, Smooth rolled edges are comfortable to hold and can protect your hands roundly, Large size sheet pan is convenient to bake plenty of food for family gathering or friends party, Also can be used as serving tray or cookie tray 【15.3 INCH BAKING RACK】15.3 x 11.25 inch cooking rack could meet different baking needs, 0.5 x 0.5 Inch dense grids avoid food sliding through the gap, 3 Cross Bars ensure stability and load-bearing, 6 x 0.75 inch supporting feet raise the flat rack up for better air circulation to make the food baked evenly, Also allow grease drip off to get a healthier meal, Good for cooling cookies or fried food, or drying vegetables and fruits 【15 INCH BAKING MAT】15 x 11 inch silicone pastry mat is perfect for baking / kneading / rolling pastry cookie, macaron, or candy, Provides an even heat distribution for your cooking, Non-stick mat releases food easily without the need of grease or cooking sprays, Avoid food sticking and the trouble of cleaning, Thicken mat will not wrinkle when baking, Good replacement for baking paper or foil, Reusable and more eco-friendly, Soft mat can be rolled or folded, Easy to store in your cabinet 【VERSATILE USE】Baking tray with cooking rack and silicone mat are ideal for cooking, roasting or cooling, Using separately or together is on your choice to create endless possibilities of baking, Using pan rack set together can keep grease on the pan and get crispy food on the rack, Baking mat used with pan or rack helps for even heating and non-stick using, To be a perfect bakeware set of home or restaurant, A thoughtful present for family or friends on anniversary, birthday, wedding","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a+3fui4VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"P&P CHEF","source_asin":"B0BCYD88X5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCYD88X5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCYD88X5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
