window.products.push({"id":609823,"name":"MieMoi Clothes Steamer Handheld Garment Steamer Portable 1500W for Home and Travel, Vertically & Horizontally Steam, Wrinkle Remover, 30s Fast Heat-up","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DB0JuQBdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"MieMoi Garment steamer 1. FAST HEAT UP & PREHEAT: Produce steam in 30 seconds 2. Removable 260ML water tank steams continuously for over 20 minutes and easy to refill 3.Multi-Functional and Suitable for all fabric: Iron, Steam and Refresh your garment or fabric including cotton, wool, polyester, plush, silk, fibre, nylon, velvet, linen and more. 4.Suitable for use with clothes, curtains, carpets, cushions, plush toys, and furniture. 5. AUTO SHUT-OFF AND OVERHEAT PROTECTION: Auto shut-off when there is insufficient water. 6.Can be steaming Vertically & Horizontally 7.Easy-to-use setting with an indication light tells you when it is ready to use and an ergonomic steam trigger that locks in place so you don't need to hold it down whilst steaming. 8.Compact, portable and easy to store, perfect for everyday use as well as for travel. 9. For perfect finish, it comes with a Static Cloth Brush to help you remove the lint & hair efficiently and a Pants Clip/Fur Brush helps you plump and refresh your clothes quickly. A:The clothes steamer is made with you in mind, providing a firm, steady grip handle, allowing you to steam effortlessly. B:Just one setting means no fiddly complicated dials, simply point and blast away those wrinkles and smells. C:Simply hang it on the back of any door and you can vertically iron as soon as you open it! Powerful constant steam with 8 – 10 minutes of use with each fill of the 260ml water tank. D:We offer a 30-Day Return Policy on items which you are not completely satisfied with. E:You have the option for a full-refund or an exchange of the item. and full 2 years guarantee","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DB0JuQBdL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MieMoi","source_asin":"B07SFLR69R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SFLR69R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SFLR69R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
