window.products.push({"id":609856,"name":"Ecodecors Earthy Teak Serenity Shower Bench 2-Tier Wooden Shower Seat Spa Bench with Curved Seat and Shelf, Natural Teak Wood Eastern Style Shower Foo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":239.38,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cmOAC7boL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nullify Imported 🛠️SUPERIOR DESIGN: EcoDecors teak shower stool features a uniquely comfortable curved seat and anti-slip flared legs. It comes with a tow-tier extra large storage shelf that can hold a variety of your bath and shower supplies. The curved seat prevents water accumulation, keeps the bathroom seat dry, and provides a more comfortable angle. Our teak bench can hold up to 250 pounds. 🏗️ADJUSTABLE FOOT PADS: Our shower seat stool with adjustable foot pads allows independent adjustment of each leg to make minor adjustments for slight slopes in shower floors and to provide non-slip stability. Our proprietary coating process ensures the teak finish's durability and resistance to moist environments. 🌳CRAFTED WITH SUPERIOR QUALITY TEAK: EcoDecors shower stool is crafted with solid teak plantation-grown logs. Teak furniture is noticeably superior to other natural wood, and bamboo furniture, which helps them to significantly outperform in environments with high moisture content, such as showers, bathrooms, and outdoor settings. 💪DURABLE & STURDY FINISH: Savor the splendor of an elegant and timeless piece of furniture with EcoDecors' earthy teak stool. This shower bench features a solid teak framework and has a stunning, ergonomic design with a proprietary 2-step coating process to provide water repellency and finish longevity. 👩WOMEN OWNED ENTERPRISE: This teak wood shower bench is provided by a certified woman-owned company. We strive for excellence in quality, value, and customer service. Our mission is to improve people's lives through beautiful designs.EcoDecors is proud to offer opportunities to women in rural villages on the island of Java, Indonesia. 🤸‍♀️VERSATILITY AND DURABILITY: EcoDecors wood shower stool can complement your home's interior design and be used as a sitting, storage, or display stool in your bath, garden, balcony, patio, or living room. Our proprietary coating process ensures the teak finish's durability and resistance to moist environments. ☔NATURALLY WATER RESISTANT: In addition to being carefully crafted solid teak wood naturally withstands water and moist environments due to its density, hardness, and high oil content. For this reason, teak wood is superior to bamboo, which is a much softer wood without the oil content.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cmOAC7boL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EcoDecors","source_asin":"B01H7SFLQK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01H7SFLQK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01H7SFLQK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
