window.products.push({"id":609953,"name":"Digital Kitchen Timer - Magnetic Countdown Countup Timer with Large LED Display Adjustable Volume and Brightness, Easy for Cooking, Teaching, Classroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DKtDetY6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to Use & Quiet Operation】 This is a generation of electronic rotating timer for kids and whole family. One key operation, no more struggling to set a timer with small buttons,whether for cooking baking, conference, exercise, fitness, work, study, lunch break, beauty, game and so on, the smart timer can help you to timing accurately, effective management of your precious time, help children to balance the game and learning. 【Time Management & Magnetic】Compared with traditional digital timers, MrToNo digital magnetic timer applies precise electronic timing device, no need to press repeatedly mechanically but can adjust fastly and timing high effectively. Rotate to get your desired time from 00:00 to 99:55 (5s is an +/- unit), and press start button to timing. Two silicone pads to avoid falling off. NOTE: PLEASE REMOVE THE TRANSPARENT FILM ON THE SILICONE PADS FOR STRONGER MAGNETIC 【Large Ultra Clear Display & Energy Saving】MrToNo large timer adapts 3 inch large LED mirror display, digits are clear at a glance. On Steady Mode when timing, the digits is always shown for you to check the remaining time. If you choose ECO Mode, the screen will turn dark after 5s but still be seen in a near distance. Without operation for some time when not timing, both modes will automatically switch to energy saving, the screen will be off to save energy and extend battery life. 【Silent Mode and Loud Alarm setting】 You can choose different volume reminders: loud (80-90dB) volume is proper for important remind, so you won't miss the loud alert even if you are in another room. Medium volume(60-75dB) can be set during reading to protect your hearing with no disturbing on your mind; Mute (0db) for study room or library, the visual timer for classroom display will blink to remind you when time arrival and won't bother anyone else. 【Multiple use】The timer is suitable for cooking, exercising, meeting, doing homework, teaching, baking, gaming, and so on. The smart timer has a collapsible stand on the back for easy placement and viewing.The timer clock is very compact and portable. It is powered by 3 AAA batteries(not included in the package).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DKtDetY6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MrToNo","source_asin":"B0BRFP3BSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-609953","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRFP3BSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRFP3BSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
